#: ../../source/configuration.rst:807
msgid ""
"Other methods to define parts are coming soon (e.g. `SDF "
"<https://github.com/fogleman/sdf>`_). Please, express your interest in "
"support for other formats by filing a corresponding issue on GitHub or "
"sending an email to `support@partcad.org <mailto:support@partcad.org>`_."
msgstr ""
